[Truth Always Triumphs].

281
00:31:46.613 --> 00:31:48.240
The two pillars of Dadasaheb.

282
00:31:48.323 --> 00:31:51.490
A maker of laws and a protector of laws.

283
00:31:55.581 --> 00:31:59.906
