1013
01:35:53.847 --> 01:35:54.514
Hmmm.

1014
01:35:54.597 --> 01:35:55.431
Jokes?

1015
01:35:55.514 --> 01:35:56.597
Naughty jokes?

1016
01:36:12.972 --> 01:36:15.764
