1268
01:57:29.662 --> 01:57:32.579
and the family rejoices,

1269
01:57:33.954 --> 01:57:38.204
for those who listen
to this glorification of mine.

1270
01:57:40.829 --> 01:57:42.787
Goddess Durga is here,

1271
01:57:44.162 --> 01:57:46.662
